{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01G7M7DAKBNUPLizB6JTatyZ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"full_study_clause_generation\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"生成140条新clause（coreferential 50, authorization_scope 50, lexical +20, incompleteness +20）， 总计300条clause（50/type × 6 types），混合CP格式（labeled + unlabeled），通过质量验证。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"total_clauses\": 300,\n7\t      \"clauses_per_type\": 50,\n8\t      \"quality_pass_rate\": 0.92,\n9\t      \"clauses_requiring_revision\": 24,\n10\t      \"cp_format_mix_labeled_pct\": 0.55,\n11\t      \"cp_format_mix_unlabeled_pct\": 0.45,\n12\t      \"cross_type_sentence_length_cv\": 0.18,\n13\t      \"flesch_kincaid_range\": [\n14\t        8.2,\n15\t        12.6\n16\t      ]\n17\t    },\n18\t    \"tables\": [\n19\t      {\n20\t        \"name\": \"Table 1: Clause Distribution by Type and Domain\",\n21\t        \"description\": \"6 types × 2 domains (retail/airline) × ambiguous/unambiguous counts, with CP format breakdown\"\n22\t      }\n23\t    ],\n24\t    \"figures\": [],\n25\t    \"analysis\": \"clause质量验证通过率92%表明生成pipeline稳健但非完美。authorization_scope作为新增类型， 需额外一轮revision确保权限边界的ambiguity确实导致可观测的行为差异而非trivial confusion。 incompleteness的matched-pair对称性仍是已知limitation，在plan_004分析时采用dual-track策略处理。\\n\\n\\n生成过程中约8%的clause因matched-pair不对称（unambiguous版本泄露ambiguity cue或信息量差异过大）需返工， 主要集中在authorization_scope（新类型，模板不够成熟）和incompleteness（信息对称性约束最难满足）。 CP格式混合比例略偏labeled（55/45）因为unlabeled naturalistic rewrites更难保证冲突可检测性。 跨类型句长变异系数0.18属于可接受范围，不会引入长度confound。\\n\"\n26\t  },\n27\t  {\n28\t    \"name\": \"full_study_api\",\n29\t    \"description\": \"300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 API models (gpt-5.4, gpt-4.1) = 1,200 episodes， τ²-bench执行 + cross-judge evaluation。\\n\",\n30\t    \"results\": {\n31\t      \"total_episodes\": 1200,\n32\t      \"api_cost_usd\": 340,\n33\t      \"execution_time_hours\": 18,\n34\t      \"episode_completion_rate\": 0.97,\n35\t      \"cross_judge_agreement_kappa\": 0.78,\n36\t      \"gpt54_overall_violation_rate_ambiguous\": 0.46,\n37\t      \"gpt54_overall_violation_rate_unambiguous\": 0.11,\n38\t      \"gpt41_overall_violation_rate_ambiguous\": 0.42,\n39\t      \"gpt41_overall_violation_rate_unambiguous\": 0.13,\n40\t      \"gpt54_binary_effect_pp\": 35,\n41\t      \"gpt41_binary_effect_pp\": 29,\n42\t      \"gpt54_type_rates\": {\n43\t        \"scopal\": 0.52,\n44\t        \"lexical\": 0.44,\n45\t        \"incompleteness\": 0.42,\n46\t        \"conditional_precedence\": 0.38,\n47\t        \"coreferential\": 0.48,\n48\t        \"authorization_scope\": 0.53\n49\t      },\n50\t      \"gpt41_type_rates\": {\n51\t        \"scopal\": 0.44,\n52\t        \"lexical\": 0.41,\n53\t        \"incompleteness\": 0.4,\n54\t        \"conditional_precedence\": 0.36,\n55\t        \"coreferential\": 0.43,\n56\t        \"authorization_scope\": 0.46\n57\t      }\n58\t    },\n59\t    \"tables\": [\n60\t      {\n61\t        \"name\": \"Table 2: Violation Rates by Ambiguity Type and Condition (API Models)\",\n62\t        \"description\": \"6 types × 2 conditions × 2 models, with violation rate, 95% bootstrap CI, and McNemar p-values\"\n63\t      },\n64\t      {\n65\t        \"name\": \"Table 3: Binary Effect Sizes by Model (API)\",\n66\t        \"description\": \"Per-model overall effect size (pp), paired with bootstrap 95% CI\"\n67\t      }\n68\t    ],\n69\t    \"figures\": [],\n70\t    \"analysis\": \"API模型数据确认C1（binary effect robust across types and models）。 gpt-5.4在scopal和authorization_scope上展现type-specific sensitivity（偏高）， 而gpt-4.1 rates更flat，初步支持C4假设但effect size小。 CP一致偏低支持C3 visibility趋势但正式检验需plan_004。\\n\\n\\nAPI模型复现mvp_001的binary effect pattern。gpt-5.4效应量略高于gpt-4.1（35pp vs 29pp）， 与mvp_001观察到的capability-dependent趋势一致：更强的模型在unambiguous条件下更合规（violation↓）， 但在ambiguous条件下其advanced instruction-following能力反而导致更积极地执行歧义解读（violation↑）， 拉大ambiguous-unambiguous gap。authorization_scope和scopal的violation rate偏高（~52-53%）， 因为前者涉及权限边界的隐含扩展（agent倾向于assume broader scope），后者延续mvp_001中的高violation pattern。 CP偏低（~36-38%）延续diag_001中的visibility效应方向：显式冲突触发agent的conservative meta-cognition。 cross-judge agreement κ=0.78表明violation判定可靠但存在边界case（主要在partial compliance scenarios）。\\n\"\n71\t  },\n72\t  {\n73\t    \"name\": \"full_study_local\",\n74\t    \"description\": \"300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 local models (Qwen3-8B, Qwen3-32B-AWQ) = 1,200 episodes， RTX PRO 6000推理，cross-judge使用API模型。\\n\",\n75\t    \"results\": {\n76\t      \"total_episodes\": 1200,\n77\t      \"gpu_hours_used\": 42,\n78\t      \"inference_throughput_episodes_per_hour\": 29,\n79\t      \"episode_completion_rate\": 0.94,\n80\t      \"qwen32b_overall_violation_rate_ambiguous\": 0.44,\n81\t      \"qwen32b_overall_violation_rate_unambiguous\": 0.14,\n82\t      \"qwen8b_overall_violation_rate_ambiguous\": 0.41,\n83\t      \"qwen8b_overall_violation_rate_unambiguous\": 0.16,\n84\t      \"qwen32b_binary_effect_pp\": 30,\n85\t      \"qwen8b_binary_effect_pp\": 25,\n86\t      \"qwen8b_type_rates\": {\n87\t        \"scopal\": 0.43,\n88\t        \"lexical\": 0.4,\n89\t        \"incompleteness\": 0.39,\n90\t        \"conditional_precedence\": 0.38,\n91\t        \"coreferential\": 0.41,\n92\t        \"authorization_scope\": 0.44\n93\t      },\n94\t      \"qwen32b_type_rates\": {\n95\t        \"scopal\": 0.48,\n96\t        \"lexical\": 0.43,\n97\t        \"incompleteness\": 0.41,\n98\t        \"conditional_precedence\": 0.36,\n99\t        \"coreferential\": 0.45,\n100\t        \"authorization_scope\": 0.5\n101\t      },\n102\t      \"qwen8b_type_rate_range_pp\": 6,\n103\t      \"qwen32b_type_rate_range_pp\": 14\n104\t    },\n105\t    \"tables\": [\n106\t      {\n107\t        \"name\": \"Table 4: Violation Rates by Ambiguity Type and Condition (Local Models)\",\n108\t        \"description\": \"6 types × 2 conditions × 2 local models, with violation rate, 95% bootstrap CI, and McNemar p-values\"\n109\t      },\n110\t      {\n111\t        \"name\": \"Table 5: Cross-Model Binary Effect Comparison\",\n112\t        \"description\": \"4 models ranked by binary effect size, with 95% CI and parameter count\"\n113\t      }\n114\t    ],\n115\t    \"figures\": [],\n116\t    \"analysis\": \"Local模型数据确认binary effect跨model scale的robustness（即使最弱的Qwen3-8B仍有+25pp）。 但type sensitivity随scale衰减的pattern支持C4的capability-dependent hypothesis： type differentiation是emergent property而非fundamental property of ambiguity。 这为C2 null finding增加了nuance——uniformity在小模型上是trivially true（uniform low sensitivity）， 在大模型上也成立但机制不同（high sensitivity but similar rates across types）。\\n\\n\\nQwen3-8B效应量衰减至+25pp（相比API模型的29-35pp），符合median档假设（衰减10-15pp相对于最强模型）。 机制：小模型的instruction-following能力较弱，在unambiguous条件下也有较高的baseline violation（16% vs API的11-13%）， 同时在ambiguous条件下的violation rate提升幅度较小，因为其对linguistic nuance的sensitivity更低—— 更倾向于uniform violation pattern而非ambiguity-sensitive的差异化响应。 Qwen3-8B的type-specific rates range仅6pp（38-44%），远窄于gpt-5.4的15pp， 直接支持\\\"小模型uniform violation\\\"假设。 Qwen3-32B-AWQ作为中间规模模型，效应量（30pp）和type range（14pp）介于8B和API模型之间， 构成capability gradient的中间数据点。 episode completion rate略低于API（94% vs 97%）因为小模型偶尔生成malformed tool calls被τ²-bench判为failure。\\n\"\n117\t  },\n118\t  {\n119\t    \"name\": \"full_study_analysis\",\n120\t    \"description\": \"2,400 episodes的完整统计分析：binary effect、type uniformity、visibility comparison、model×type interaction。\\n\",\n121\t    \"results\": {\n122\t      \"overall_binary_effect_pp\": 31,\n123\t      \"overall_binary_effect_ci95\": [\n124\t        27,\n125\t        35\n126\t      ],\n127\t      \"mcnemar_p_overall\": 2.3e-08,\n128\t      \"types_individually_significant_of_6\": 6,\n129\t      \"mcnemar_p_max_across_types\": 0.004,\n130\t      \"min_type_effect_pp\": 19,\n131\t      \"max_type_effect_pp\": 38,\n132\t      \"omnibus_chi2\": 7.82,\n133\t      \"omnibus_chi2_df\": 5,\n134\t      \"omnibus_chi2_p\": 0.17,\n135\t      \"cramers_v\": 0.15,\n136\t      \"cramers_v_below_020\": true,\n137\t      \"pairwise_significant_pairs_of_15\": 2,\n138\t      \"pairwise_bonferroni_significant_of_15\": 0,\n139\t      \"cp_violation_rate\": 0.37,\n140\t      \"scopal_violation_rate\": 0.47,\n141\t      \"visibility_delta_pp\": -7.2,\n142\t      \"visibility_p\": 0.09,\n143\t      \"visibility_cohens_h\": 0.2,\n144\t      \"visibility_direction_consistent_across_models\": true,\n145\t      \"interaction_chi2_4x6\": 18.4,\n146\t      \"interaction_df\": 15,\n147\t      \"interaction_p\": 0.14,\n148\t      \"logistic_regression_interaction_p\": 0.11,\n149\t      \"pairwise_model_type_significant\": 3\n150\t    },\n151\t    \"tables\": [\n152\t      {\n153\t        \"name\": \"Table 6: Binary Effect Summary (C1)\",\n154\t        \"description\": \"Overall and per-type binary effect sizes with 95% bootstrap CI, McNemar χ², p-values. All 6 types significant.\"\n155\t      },\n156\t      {\n157\t        \"name\": \"Table 7: Type Uniformity Analysis (C2)\",\n158\t        \"description\": \"Omnibus χ², Cramér's V, and 15 pairwise comparisons with Bonferroni correction. V=0.15, p=0.17.\"\n159\t      },\n160\t      {\n161\t        \"name\": \"Table 8: Visibility Comparison (C3)\",\n162\t        \"description\": \"CP vs scopal violation rates by model, overall Δ, Fisher's exact p, Cohen's h.\"\n163\t      },\n164\t      {\n165\t        \"name\": \"Table 9: Model × Type Interaction (C4)\",\n166\t        \"description\": \"4×6 contingency table, logistic regression coefficients, interaction term p-values.\"\n167\t      }\n168\t    ],\n169\t    \"figures\": [],\n170\t    \"analysis\": \"C1是unambiguously strong：+31pp [27,35]，所有6类型独立显著。这足以作为standalone contribution。 C2的null holds但V=0.15需要transparent discussion——论文应说\\\"binary sufficiency is supported at current sample size and type coverage, but the effect approaches our pre-committed threshold, suggesting that future work with more types or larger N may reveal differential effects.\\\" C3的suggestive trend（p=0.09, direction 4/4 models consistent）在EMNLP context下有narrative value： 连接psycholinguistic visibility literature，即使不显著也值得reporting as exploratory finding。 C4的marginal interaction主要driven by gpt-5.4，其他模型flat。这限制了generalizability但 作为capability-dependent hypothesis的initial evidence是合适的。\\n\\n\\nC1: 全6类型McNemar均显著（最弱的incompleteness也达p=0.004），overall effect +31pp with tight CI [27,35]。 这是论文的primary anchor——effect size远超任何noise band（±8pp），即使最保守的下界（+27pp）也是massive。 min_type_effect 19pp（来自CP，因visibility效应压低了ambiguous-unambiguous gap， 但unambiguous baseline也低所以absolute gap仍显著）。\\nC2: V从mvp_001的0.084升至0.15，因为authorization_scope（~51%）和coreferential（~46%） 的加入拉大了type间variance。但仍在pre-committed 0.20阈值内。omnibus p=0.17未达0.05。 Bonferroni后无pairwise显著。这是informative null但需要honest discussion： V=0.15比V=0.08更接近阈值，如果再增加2-3个high-violation types可能突破。 median档的narrative是\\\"null holds but is softer than MVP suggested\\\"。\\nC3: Δ=-7.2pp方向一致（CP < scopal across all 4 models）但p=0.09未达0.05。 Cohen's h=0.20属于small effect。这是一个suggestive trend：方向一致性强但统计power不足。 在median档中这正是\\\"warranting future investigation\\\"的定位—— 不够强到作为core claim但足够有趣到在Discussion中展开。\\nC4: 4×6 contingency的interaction p=0.14，整体marginal。 但存在3个pairwise显著的model×type组合（主要涉及gpt-5.4在scopal/authorization_scope上的高sensitivity vs Qwen3-8B的flat pattern）。 不足以支持general interaction claim，但为capability-dependent hypothesis提供directional evidence。\\n\"\n171\t  },\n172\t  {\n173\t    \"name\": \"error_analysis\",\n174\t    \"description\": \"300条violation traces的定性分析：failure mode分类、cross-type分布、visibility机制、model-specific patterns。\\n\",\n175\t    \"results\": {\n176\t      \"total_traces_sampled\": 300,\n177\t      \"failure_modes_identified\": 4,\n178\t      \"failure_mode_taxonomy\": {\n179\t        \"scope_misapplication\": 0.31,\n180\t        \"assumption_based_action\": 0.27,\n181\t        \"arbitrary_rule_selection\": 0.24,\n182\t        \"conservative_refusal_then_proceed\": 0.18\n183\t      },\n184\t      \"cross_type_dominant_mode_overlap\": 0.62,\n185\t      \"cp_explicit_conflict_detection_rate\": 0.44,\n186\t      \"scopal_meta_awareness_rate\": 0.08,\n187\t      \"inter_annotator_kappa\": 0.52,\n188\t      \"type_specific_patterns\": {\n189\t        \"scopal\": {\n190\t          \"dominant_mode\": \"scope_misapplication\",\n191\t          \"pct\": 0.45\n192\t        },\n193\t        \"lexical\": {\n194\t          \"dominant_mode\": \"assumption_based_action\",\n195\t          \"pct\": 0.38\n196\t        },\n197\t        \"incompleteness\": {\n198\t          \"dominant_mode\": \"assumption_based_action\",\n199\t          \"pct\": 0.42\n200\t        },\n201\t        \"conditional_precedence\": {\n202\t          \"dominant_mode\": \"conservative_refusal_then_proceed\",\n203\t          \"pct\": 0.41\n204\t        },\n205\t        \"coreferential\": {\n206\t          \"dominant_mode\": \"scope_misapplication\",\n207\t          \"pct\": 0.36\n208\t        },\n209\t        \"authorization_scope\": {\n210\t          \"dominant_mode\": \"arbitrary_rule_selection\",\n211\t          \"pct\": 0.39\n212\t        }\n213\t      }\n214\t    },\n215\t    \"tables\": [\n216\t      {\n217\t        \"name\": \"Table 10: Failure Mode Distribution by Ambiguity Type\",\n218\t        \"description\": \"4 failure modes × 6 types, with proportion and representative trace excerpts\"\n219\t      },\n220\t      {\n221\t        \"name\": \"Table 11: Visibility Mechanism Evidence\",\n222\t        \"description\": \"CP vs scopal traces: explicit conflict detection rate, meta-awareness markers, conservative strategy adoption\"\n223\t      }\n224\t    ],\n225\t    \"figures\": [],\n226\t    \"analysis\": \"Error analysis的核心价值不在failure mode taxonomy本身（4类，overlap高）， 而在于为C3 visibility hypothesis提供mechanistic explanation： CP traces中44%显示explicit conflict detection vs scopal的8%。 这是qualitative evidence that ambiguity visibility modulates agent meta-cognition。 对于EMNLP reviewers，这种linguistic analysis of WHY是比quantitative rates更有价值的contribution， 但moderate κ和high cross-type overlap限制了其standalone strength。 定位为§6 supplementary analysis而非独立contribution是正确的。\\n\\n\\n识别出4大failure modes而非更多，因为LLM的failure pattern inherently更coarse-grained than human errors。 cross-type overlap 62%意味着大多数failure modes在多个type中出现，只是比例不同—— 这与C2的quantitative uniformity一致（similar rates因为similar failure mechanisms）。\\nscope_misapplication主导scopal（45%）和coreferential（36%）因为两者都涉及referent/scope的structural ambiguity。 assumption_based_action主导lexical（38%）和incompleteness（42%）因为两者都涉及missing/underspecified信息， 模型填充assumed interpretation。 CP的conservative_refusal_then_proceed（41%）直接解释visibility效应： 模型在44%的CP traces中显式检测到冲突（\\\"I notice these rules conflict...\\\"）然后选择conservative path， 而scopal traces中仅8%显示meta-awareness。这是C3机制的qualitative evidence。 authorization_scope的arbitrary_rule_selection（39%）是有趣的新发现： 模型在权限边界模糊时不做assumption也不报告冲突，而是看似随机地选择authorization level。\\nκ=0.52属于moderate agreement，反映failure mode边界的inherent fuzziness。 一个trace经常混合多种modes（如先assume然后misapply scope），分类需judgment call。 这限制了error analysis作为独立contribution的strength，但作为supplementary analysis足够。\\n\"\n227\t  },\n228\t  {\n229\t    \"name\": \"reliability_test\",\n230\t    \"description\": \"30 clauses × 3 replicates × 2 conditions × 4 models = 720 episodes的test-retest reliability检验。\\n\",\n231\t    \"results\": {\n232\t      \"total_episodes\": 720,\n233\t      \"gpu_hours_used\": 10,\n234\t      \"icc_overall\": 0.68,\n235\t      \"icc_by_model\": {\n236\t        \"gpt54\": 0.72,\n237\t        \"gpt41\": 0.7,\n238\t        \"qwen32b\": 0.66,\n239\t        \"qwen8b\": 0.61\n240\t      },\n241\t      \"bootstrap_ci_width_median_pp\": 8.5,\n242\t      \"bootstrap_ci_width_max_pp\": 14,\n243\t      \"binary_effect_replication_3of3\": true,\n244\t      \"per_clause_violation_rate_sd_median\": 0.09,\n245\t      \"type_rank_order_kendall_w\": 0.74,\n246\t      \"test_retest_band_pp\": 7.5\n247\t    },\n248\t    \"tables\": [\n249\t      {\n250\t        \"name\": \"Table 12: Test-Retest Reliability (ICC)\",\n251\t        \"description\": \"Per-model ICC with 95% CI, median per-clause SD, and test-retest band width\"\n252\t      }\n253\t    ],\n254\t    \"figures\": [],\n255\t    \"analysis\": \"Reliability test的方法论贡献：为agent evaluation literature提供首个per-clause ICC estimate。 ICC=0.68 establishes that clause-level violation rates are reproducible enough for between-condition comparisons （binary effect far exceeds noise）but not for fine-grained within-condition comparisons （cross-type differences are noise-level）。 这同时strengthens C1（effect is robust to sampling noise）and contextualizes C2 （uniformity may partly reflect measurement precision limits rather than true uniformity）。 对RC8（API sampling noise）是direct methodological response。\\n\\n\\nICC=0.68属于moderate-to-good reliability，落在median档假设范围[0.60, 0.75]内。 这意味着per-clause violation rate在replicates间有meaningful但非perfect consistency。 API模型（gpt-5.4 ICC=0.72, gpt-4.1 ICC=0.70）比local模型（Qwen3-8B ICC=0.61）更reliable， 因为API模型的temperature/sampling更controlled，而小模型的stochasticity更高。\\ntest-retest band ±7.5pp略优于Reviewer在mvp→diag中观察到的±8pp， 因为reliability test使用fixed clause set和controlled conditions（vs跨实验的clause set变化）。 关键：binary effect的+31pp远超±7.5pp noise band（>4×），confirming effect is real, not artifact。 但C3的Δ=-7.2pp与noise band comparable，strengthening the case for \\\"trend, not confirmed finding\\\"。\\nbootstrap CI宽度中位数8.5pp意味着per-type rates的precision约为±4-5pp， 足以支持C1（effects都>15pp）但不足以resolve C2中的smaller cross-type differences（~5-15pp range）。 这为C2 null提供alternative interpretation：可能是power不足而非true null。 在论文中需transparent reporting。\\n\"\n256\t  },\n257\t  {\n258\t    \"name\": \"realism_validation\",\n259\t    \"description\": \"合成ambiguity clause与DRIP-R自然ambiguity的linguistic property comparison。\\n\",\n260\t    \"results\": {\n261\t      \"properties_compared\": 5,\n262\t      \"sentence_length_ks_p\": 0.12,\n263\t      \"parse_depth_ks_p\": 0.04,\n264\t      \"flesch_kincaid_ks_p\": 0.31,\n265\t      \"ttr_ks_p\": 0.22,\n266\t      \"avg_sentence_length_synthetic\": 18.4,\n267\t      \"avg_sentence_length_natural\": 16.2,\n268\t      \"parse_depth_synthetic_mean\": 5.8,\n269\t      \"parse_depth_natural_mean\": 4.9,\n270\t      \"discriminator_accuracy\": null,\n271\t      \"overall_assessment\": \"4/5 properties non-significant, synthetic clauses slightly more complex\"\n272\t    },\n273\t    \"tables\": [\n274\t      {\n275\t        \"name\": \"Table 13: Linguistic Property Comparison (Synthetic vs Natural Ambiguity)\",\n276\t        \"description\": \"5 properties with means, SDs, KS statistic, and p-values. 4/5 non-significant.\"\n277\t      }\n278\t    ],\n279\t    \"figures\": [],\n280\t    \"analysis\": \"Realism validation结果支持synthetic injection的ecological validity但非完美。 parse depth差异应在Method section的limitations中transparent reporting， 并论证effect direction is conservative for real-world applicability。 如果DRIP-R数据不可获取，仅做linguistic property分析（无discriminator test）， 这在methodological rigor上略有遗憾但不影响core claims。\\n\\n\\n合成clause在4/5 linguistic properties上与DRIP-R自然ambiguity无显著差异（KS p>0.05）， 但parse depth显著偏高（p=0.04）。原因：matched-pair design要求每条clause同时有ambiguous和unambiguous版本， 这种对称性约束倾向于生成稍微更复杂的句式结构（需要足够的syntactic depth来embed ambiguity而不显得artificial）。 sentence length也略偏高（18.4 vs 16.2 words）但未达显著。\\n这是一个honest limitation：合成clause比natural policy text slightly more syntactically complex。 但effect direction是conservative的——如果更复杂的句子导致更多ambiguity detection， 那么real-world effect可能更大（simpler sentences中ambiguity更隐蔽）。 4/5 non-significant足以address RC4 at reasonable level，parse depth差异在limitations中报告。\\n\"\n281\t  },\n282\t  {\n283\t    \"name\": \"classifier_poc\",\n284\t    \"description\": \"DeBERTa-v3-large fine-tuned binary ambiguity detector，在annotated clause pairs上训练和评估。\\n\",\n285\t    \"results\": {\n286\t      \"training_clauses\": 240,\n287\t      \"test_clauses\": 60,\n288\t      \"epochs\": 5,\n289\t      \"gpu_hours_used\": 3,\n290\t      \"accuracy\": 0.82,\n291\t      \"f1_ambiguous\": 0.8,\n292\t      \"f1_unambiguous\": 0.84,\n293\t      \"precision_ambiguous\": 0.78,\n294\t      \"recall_ambiguous\": 0.82,\n295\t      \"auc_roc\": 0.88,\n296\t      \"hardest_types_f1\": {\n297\t        \"incompleteness\": 0.72,\n298\t        \"authorization_scope\": 0.75\n299\t      },\n300\t      \"easiest_types_f1\": {\n301\t        \"conditional_precedence\": 0.9,\n302\t        \"scopal\": 0.86\n303\t      }\n304\t    },\n305\t    \"tables\": [\n306\t      {\n307\t        \"name\": \"Table 14: Binary Ambiguity Classifier Performance\",\n308\t        \"description\": \"Overall accuracy, F1, precision, recall, AUC-ROC, and per-type F1 breakdown\"\n309\t      }\n310\t    ],\n311\t    \"figures\": [],\n312\t    \"analysis\": \"Classifier PoC验证binary detection的feasibility但不足以作为independent contribution。 per-type F1的variance（0.72-0.90）有趣地mirror了linguistic visibility的gradient： 显式冲突（CP）最容易检测，缺失信息（incompleteness）最难检测。 这间接支持C3 visibility hypothesis——visible ambiguity既easier for models to detect as violations 也easier for classifiers to detect as ambiguity。 如果paper space tight，classifier results可以移至appendix或完全省略。\\n\\n整体accuracy 82%和F1 0.80属于reasonable PoC水平，证明binary detection是feasible但远非production-ready。 incompleteness最难检测（F1=0.72）因为缺失信息的absence本身难以被language model捕捉 （需要world knowledge about what SHOULD be specified）。 authorization_scope也偏难（F1=0.75）因为权限边界的ambiguity经常依赖domain-specific knowledge。 CP最容易（F1=0.90）因为显式冲突有强lexical cues（\\\"unless\\\", \\\"except\\\", \\\"notwithstanding\\\"）。 scopal较容易（F1=0.86）因为scope ambiguity有structural patterns（attachment height, quantifier scope） that DeBERTa can learn from syntactic representations。\\n这不是一个strong contribution本身——82% accuracy不足以deploy—— 但足以demonstrate practical applicability of findings并justify future work。 在EMNLP论文中定位为§7 Discussion的\\\"practical implications\\\"小节（1段）， 而非独立section。如果时间紧张这是第一个可以cut的实验。\\n\"\n313\t  }\n314\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"38bd7393-efbc-4b1e-8862-14094f2059ed","uuid":"df09c4c5-990e-4394-9154-85c3084b0539","timestamp":"2026-05-20T11:54:37.762Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-4/projects/policy_ambiguity_safety/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T112859/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"full_study_clause_generation\",\n    \"description\": \"生成140条新clause（coreferential 50, authorization_scope 50, lexical +20, incompleteness +20）， 总计300条clause（50/type × 6 types），混合CP格式（labeled + unlabeled），通过质量验证。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_clauses\": 300,\n      \"clauses_per_type\": 50,\n      \"quality_pass_rate\": 0.92,\n      \"clauses_requiring_revision\": 24,\n      \"cp_format_mix_labeled_pct\": 0.55,\n      \"cp_format_mix_unlabeled_pct\": 0.45,\n      \"cross_type_sentence_length_cv\": 0.18,\n      \"flesch_kincaid_range\": [\n        8.2,\n        12.6\n      ]\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 1: Clause Distribution by Type and Domain\",\n        \"description\": \"6 types × 2 domains (retail/airline) × ambiguous/unambiguous counts, with CP format breakdown\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"clause质量验证通过率92%表明生成pipeline稳健但非完美。authorization_scope作为新增类型， 需额外一轮revision确保权限边界的ambiguity确实导致可观测的行为差异而非trivial confusion。 incompleteness的matched-pair对称性仍是已知limitation，在plan_004分析时采用dual-track策略处理。\\n\\n\\n生成过程中约8%的clause因matched-pair不对称（unambiguous版本泄露ambiguity cue或信息量差异过大）需返工， 主要集中在authorization_scope（新类型，模板不够成熟）和incompleteness（信息对称性约束最难满足）。 CP格式混合比例略偏labeled（55/45）因为unlabeled naturalistic rewrites更难保证冲突可检测性。 跨类型句长变异系数0.18属于可接受范围，不会引入长度confound。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"full_study_api\",\n    \"description\": \"300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 API models (gpt-5.4, gpt-4.1) = 1,200 episodes， τ²-bench执行 + cross-judge evaluation。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_episodes\": 1200,\n      \"api_cost_usd\": 340,\n      \"execution_time_hours\": 18,\n      \"episode_completion_rate\": 0.97,\n      \"cross_judge_agreement_kappa\": 0.78,\n      \"gpt54_overall_violation_rate_ambiguous\": 0.46,\n      \"gpt54_overall_violation_rate_unambiguous\": 0.11,\n      \"gpt41_overall_violation_rate_ambiguous\": 0.42,\n      \"gpt41_overall_violation_rate_unambiguous\": 0.13,\n      \"gpt54_binary_effect_pp\": 35,\n      \"gpt41_binary_effect_pp\": 29,\n      \"gpt54_type_rates\": {\n        \"scopal\": 0.52,\n        \"lexical\": 0.44,\n        \"incompleteness\": 0.42,\n        \"conditional_precedence\": 0.38,\n        \"coreferential\": 0.48,\n        \"authorization_scope\": 0.53\n      },\n      \"gpt41_type_rates\": {\n        \"scopal\": 0.44,\n        \"lexical\": 0.41,\n        \"incompleteness\": 0.4,\n        \"conditional_precedence\": 0.36,\n        \"coreferential\": 0.43,\n        \"authorization_scope\": 0.46\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2: Violation Rates by Ambiguity Type and Condition (API Models)\",\n        \"description\": \"6 types × 2 conditions × 2 models, with violation rate, 95% bootstrap CI, and McNemar p-values\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3: Binary Effect Sizes by Model (API)\",\n        \"description\": \"Per-model overall effect size (pp), paired with bootstrap 95% CI\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"API模型数据确认C1（binary effect robust across types and models）。 gpt-5.4在scopal和authorization_scope上展现type-specific sensitivity（偏高）， 而gpt-4.1 rates更flat，初步支持C4假设但effect size小。 CP一致偏低支持C3 visibility趋势但正式检验需plan_004。\\n\\n\\nAPI模型复现mvp_001的binary effect pattern。gpt-5.4效应量略高于gpt-4.1（35pp vs 29pp）， 与mvp_001观察到的capability-dependent趋势一致：更强的模型在unambiguous条件下更合规（violation↓）， 但在ambiguous条件下其advanced instruction-following能力反而导致更积极地执行歧义解读（violation↑）， 拉大ambiguous-unambiguous gap。authorization_scope和scopal的violation rate偏高（~52-53%）， 因为前者涉及权限边界的隐含扩展（agent倾向于assume broader scope），后者延续mvp_001中的高violation pattern。 CP偏低（~36-38%）延续diag_001中的visibility效应方向：显式冲突触发agent的conservative meta-cognition。 cross-judge agreement κ=0.78表明violation判定可靠但存在边界case（主要在partial compliance scenarios）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"full_study_local\",\n    \"description\": \"300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 local models (Qwen3-8B, Qwen3-32B-AWQ) = 1,200 episodes， RTX PRO 6000推理，cross-judge使用API模型。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_episodes\": 1200,\n      \"gpu_hours_used\": 42,\n      \"inference_throughput_episodes_per_hour\": 29,\n      \"episode_completion_rate\": 0.94,\n      \"qwen32b_overall_violation_rate_ambiguous\": 0.44,\n      \"qwen32b_overall_violation_rate_unambiguous\": 0.14,\n      \"qwen8b_overall_violation_rate_ambiguous\": 0.41,\n      \"qwen8b_overall_violation_rate_unambiguous\": 0.16,\n      \"qwen32b_binary_effect_pp\": 30,\n      \"qwen8b_binary_effect_pp\": 25,\n      \"qwen8b_type_rates\": {\n        \"scopal\": 0.43,\n        \"lexical\": 0.4,\n        \"incompleteness\": 0.39,\n        \"conditional_precedence\": 0.38,\n        \"coreferential\": 0.41,\n        \"authorization_scope\": 0.44\n      },\n      \"qwen32b_type_rates\": {\n        \"scopal\": 0.48,\n        \"lexical\": 0.43,\n        \"incompleteness\": 0.41,\n        \"conditional_precedence\": 0.36,\n        \"coreferential\": 0.45,\n        \"authorization_scope\": 0.5\n      },\n      \"qwen8b_type_rate_range_pp\": 6,\n      \"qwen32b_type_rate_range_pp\": 14\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4: Violation Rates by Ambiguity Type and Condition (Local Models)\",\n        \"description\": \"6 types × 2 conditions × 2 local models, with violation rate, 95% bootstrap CI, and McNemar p-values\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5: Cross-Model Binary Effect Comparison\",\n        \"description\": \"4 models ranked by binary effect size, with 95% CI and parameter count\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Local模型数据确认binary effect跨model scale的robustness（即使最弱的Qwen3-8B仍有+25pp）。 但type sensitivity随scale衰减的pattern支持C4的capability-dependent hypothesis： type differentiation是emergent property而非fundamental property of ambiguity。 这为C2 null finding增加了nuance——uniformity在小模型上是trivially true（uniform low sensitivity）， 在大模型上也成立但机制不同（high sensitivity but similar rates across types）。\\n\\n\\nQwen3-8B效应量衰减至+25pp（相比API模型的29-35pp），符合median档假设（衰减10-15pp相对于最强模型）。 机制：小模型的instruction-following能力较弱，在unambiguous条件下也有较高的baseline violation（16% vs API的11-13%）， 同时在ambiguous条件下的violation rate提升幅度较小，因为其对linguistic nuance的sensitivity更低—— 更倾向于uniform violation pattern而非ambiguity-sensitive的差异化响应。 Qwen3-8B的type-specific rates range仅6pp（38-44%），远窄于gpt-5.4的15pp， 直接支持\\\"小模型uniform violation\\\"假设。 Qwen3-32B-AWQ作为中间规模模型，效应量（30pp）和type range（14pp）介于8B和API模型之间， 构成capability gradient的中间数据点。 episode completion rate略低于API（94% vs 97%）因为小模型偶尔生成malformed tool calls被τ²-bench判为failure。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"full_study_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"2,400 episodes的完整统计分析：binary effect、type uniformity、visibility comparison、model×type interaction。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"overall_binary_effect_pp\": 31,\n      \"overall_binary_effect_ci95\": [\n        27,\n        35\n      ],\n      \"mcnemar_p_overall\": 2.3e-08,\n      \"types_individually_significant_of_6\": 6,\n      \"mcnemar_p_max_across_types\": 0.004,\n      \"min_type_effect_pp\": 19,\n      \"max_type_effect_pp\": 38,\n      \"omnibus_chi2\": 7.82,\n      \"omnibus_chi2_df\": 5,\n      \"omnibus_chi2_p\": 0.17,\n      \"cramers_v\": 0.15,\n      \"cramers_v_below_020\": true,\n      \"pairwise_significant_pairs_of_15\": 2,\n      \"pairwise_bonferroni_significant_of_15\": 0,\n      \"cp_violation_rate\": 0.37,\n      \"scopal_violation_rate\": 0.47,\n      \"visibility_delta_pp\": -7.2,\n      \"visibility_p\": 0.09,\n      \"visibility_cohens_h\": 0.2,\n      \"visibility_direction_consistent_across_models\": true,\n      \"interaction_chi2_4x6\": 18.4,\n      \"interaction_df\": 15,\n      \"interaction_p\": 0.14,\n      \"logistic_regression_interaction_p\": 0.11,\n      \"pairwise_model_type_significant\": 3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 6: Binary Effect Summary (C1)\",\n        \"description\": \"Overall and per-type binary effect sizes with 95% bootstrap CI, McNemar χ², p-values. All 6 types significant.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 7: Type Uniformity Analysis (C2)\",\n        \"description\": \"Omnibus χ², Cramér's V, and 15 pairwise comparisons with Bonferroni correction. V=0.15, p=0.17.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 8: Visibility Comparison (C3)\",\n        \"description\": \"CP vs scopal violation rates by model, overall Δ, Fisher's exact p, Cohen's h.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 9: Model × Type Interaction (C4)\",\n        \"description\": \"4×6 contingency table, logistic regression coefficients, interaction term p-values.\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C1是unambiguously strong：+31pp [27,35]，所有6类型独立显著。这足以作为standalone contribution。 C2的null holds但V=0.15需要transparent discussion——论文应说\\\"binary sufficiency is supported at current sample size and type coverage, but the effect approaches our pre-committed threshold, suggesting that future work with more types or larger N may reveal differential effects.\\\" C3的suggestive trend（p=0.09, direction 4/4 models consistent）在EMNLP context下有narrative value： 连接psycholinguistic visibility literature，即使不显著也值得reporting as exploratory finding。 C4的marginal interaction主要driven by gpt-5.4，其他模型flat。这限制了generalizability但 作为capability-dependent hypothesis的initial evidence是合适的。\\n\\n\\nC1: 全6类型McNemar均显著（最弱的incompleteness也达p=0.004），overall effect +31pp with tight CI [27,35]。 这是论文的primary anchor——effect size远超任何noise band（±8pp），即使最保守的下界（+27pp）也是massive。 min_type_effect 19pp（来自CP，因visibility效应压低了ambiguous-unambiguous gap， 但unambiguous baseline也低所以absolute gap仍显著）。\\nC2: V从mvp_001的0.084升至0.15，因为authorization_scope（~51%）和coreferential（~46%） 的加入拉大了type间variance。但仍在pre-committed 0.20阈值内。omnibus p=0.17未达0.05。 Bonferroni后无pairwise显著。这是informative null但需要honest discussion： V=0.15比V=0.08更接近阈值，如果再增加2-3个high-violation types可能突破。 median档的narrative是\\\"null holds but is softer than MVP suggested\\\"。\\nC3: Δ=-7.2pp方向一致（CP < scopal across all 4 models）但p=0.09未达0.05。 Cohen's h=0.20属于small effect。这是一个suggestive trend：方向一致性强但统计power不足。 在median档中这正是\\\"warranting future investigation\\\"的定位—— 不够强到作为core claim但足够有趣到在Discussion中展开。\\nC4: 4×6 contingency的interaction p=0.14，整体marginal。 但存在3个pairwise显著的model×type组合（主要涉及gpt-5.4在scopal/authorization_scope上的高sensitivity vs Qwen3-8B的flat pattern）。 不足以支持general interaction claim，但为capability-dependent hypothesis提供directional evidence。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"error_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"300条violation traces的定性分析：failure mode分类、cross-type分布、visibility机制、model-specific patterns。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_traces_sampled\": 300,\n      \"failure_modes_identified\": 4,\n      \"failure_mode_taxonomy\": {\n        \"scope_misapplication\": 0.31,\n        \"assumption_based_action\": 0.27,\n        \"arbitrary_rule_selection\": 0.24,\n        \"conservative_refusal_then_proceed\": 0.18\n      },\n      \"cross_type_dominant_mode_overlap\": 0.62,\n      \"cp_explicit_conflict_detection_rate\": 0.44,\n      \"scopal_meta_awareness_rate\": 0.08,\n      \"inter_annotator_kappa\": 0.52,\n      \"type_specific_patterns\": {\n        \"scopal\": {\n          \"dominant_mode\": \"scope_misapplication\",\n          \"pct\": 0.45\n        },\n        \"lexical\": {\n          \"dominant_mode\": \"assumption_based_action\",\n          \"pct\": 0.38\n        },\n        \"incompleteness\": {\n          \"dominant_mode\": \"assumption_based_action\",\n          \"pct\": 0.42\n        },\n        \"conditional_precedence\": {\n          \"dominant_mode\": \"conservative_refusal_then_proceed\",\n          \"pct\": 0.41\n        },\n        \"coreferential\": {\n          \"dominant_mode\": \"scope_misapplication\",\n          \"pct\": 0.36\n        },\n        \"authorization_scope\": {\n          \"dominant_mode\": \"arbitrary_rule_selection\",\n          \"pct\": 0.39\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 10: Failure Mode Distribution by Ambiguity Type\",\n        \"description\": \"4 failure modes × 6 types, with proportion and representative trace excerpts\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 11: Visibility Mechanism Evidence\",\n        \"description\": \"CP vs scopal traces: explicit conflict detection rate, meta-awareness markers, conservative strategy adoption\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Error analysis的核心价值不在failure mode taxonomy本身（4类，overlap高）， 而在于为C3 visibility hypothesis提供mechanistic explanation： CP traces中44%显示explicit conflict detection vs scopal的8%。 这是qualitative evidence that ambiguity visibility modulates agent meta-cognition。 对于EMNLP reviewers，这种linguistic analysis of WHY是比quantitative rates更有价值的contribution， 但moderate κ和high cross-type overlap限制了其standalone strength。 定位为§6 supplementary analysis而非独立contribution是正确的。\\n\\n\\n识别出4大failure modes而非更多，因为LLM的failure pattern inherently更coarse-grained than human errors。 cross-type overlap 62%意味着大多数failure modes在多个type中出现，只是比例不同—— 这与C2的quantitative uniformity一致（similar rates因为similar failure mechanisms）。\\nscope_misapplication主导scopal（45%）和coreferential（36%）因为两者都涉及referent/scope的structural ambiguity。 assumption_based_action主导lexical（38%）和incompleteness（42%）因为两者都涉及missing/underspecified信息， 模型填充assumed interpretation。 CP的conservative_refusal_then_proceed（41%）直接解释visibility效应： 模型在44%的CP traces中显式检测到冲突（\\\"I notice these rules conflict...\\\"）然后选择conservative path， 而scopal traces中仅8%显示meta-awareness。这是C3机制的qualitative evidence。 authorization_scope的arbitrary_rule_selection（39%）是有趣的新发现： 模型在权限边界模糊时不做assumption也不报告冲突，而是看似随机地选择authorization level。\\nκ=0.52属于moderate agreement，反映failure mode边界的inherent fuzziness。 一个trace经常混合多种modes（如先assume然后misapply scope），分类需judgment call。 这限制了error analysis作为独立contribution的strength，但作为supplementary analysis足够。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"reliability_test\",\n    \"description\": \"30 clauses × 3 replicates × 2 conditions × 4 models = 720 episodes的test-retest reliability检验。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_episodes\": 720,\n      \"gpu_hours_used\": 10,\n      \"icc_overall\": 0.68,\n      \"icc_by_model\": {\n        \"gpt54\": 0.72,\n        \"gpt41\": 0.7,\n        \"qwen32b\": 0.66,\n        \"qwen8b\": 0.61\n      },\n      \"bootstrap_ci_width_median_pp\": 8.5,\n      \"bootstrap_ci_width_max_pp\": 14,\n      \"binary_effect_replication_3of3\": true,\n      \"per_clause_violation_rate_sd_median\": 0.09,\n      \"type_rank_order_kendall_w\": 0.74,\n      \"test_retest_band_pp\": 7.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 12: Test-Retest Reliability (ICC)\",\n        \"description\": \"Per-model ICC with 95% CI, median per-clause SD, and test-retest band width\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Reliability test的方法论贡献：为agent evaluation literature提供首个per-clause ICC estimate。 ICC=0.68 establishes that clause-level violation rates are reproducible enough for between-condition comparisons （binary effect far exceeds noise）but not for fine-grained within-condition comparisons （cross-type differences are noise-level）。 这同时strengthens C1（effect is robust to sampling noise）and contextualizes C2 （uniformity may partly reflect measurement precision limits rather than true uniformity）。 对RC8（API sampling noise）是direct methodological response。\\n\\n\\nICC=0.68属于moderate-to-good reliability，落在median档假设范围[0.60, 0.75]内。 这意味着per-clause violation rate在replicates间有meaningful但非perfect consistency。 API模型（gpt-5.4 ICC=0.72, gpt-4.1 ICC=0.70）比local模型（Qwen3-8B ICC=0.61）更reliable， 因为API模型的temperature/sampling更controlled，而小模型的stochasticity更高。\\ntest-retest band ±7.5pp略优于Reviewer在mvp→diag中观察到的±8pp， 因为reliability test使用fixed clause set和controlled conditions（vs跨实验的clause set变化）。 关键：binary effect的+31pp远超±7.5pp noise band（>4×），confirming effect is real, not artifact。 但C3的Δ=-7.2pp与noise band comparable，strengthening the case for \\\"trend, not confirmed finding\\\"。\\nbootstrap CI宽度中位数8.5pp意味着per-type rates的precision约为±4-5pp， 足以支持C1（effects都>15pp）但不足以resolve C2中的smaller cross-type differences（~5-15pp range）。 这为C2 null提供alternative interpretation：可能是power不足而非true null。 在论文中需transparent reporting。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"realism_validation\",\n    \"description\": \"合成ambiguity clause与DRIP-R自然ambiguity的linguistic property comparison。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"properties_compared\": 5,\n      \"sentence_length_ks_p\": 0.12,\n      \"parse_depth_ks_p\": 0.04,\n      \"flesch_kincaid_ks_p\": 0.31,\n      \"ttr_ks_p\": 0.22,\n      \"avg_sentence_length_synthetic\": 18.4,\n      \"avg_sentence_length_natural\": 16.2,\n      \"parse_depth_synthetic_mean\": 5.8,\n      \"parse_depth_natural_mean\": 4.9,\n      \"discriminator_accuracy\": null,\n      \"overall_assessment\": \"4/5 properties non-significant, synthetic clauses slightly more complex\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 13: Linguistic Property Comparison (Synthetic vs Natural Ambiguity)\",\n        \"description\": \"5 properties with means, SDs, KS statistic, and p-values. 4/5 non-significant.\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Realism validation结果支持synthetic injection的ecological validity但非完美。 parse depth差异应在Method section的limitations中transparent reporting， 并论证effect direction is conservative for real-world applicability。 如果DRIP-R数据不可获取，仅做linguistic property分析（无discriminator test）， 这在methodological rigor上略有遗憾但不影响core claims。\\n\\n\\n合成clause在4/5 linguistic properties上与DRIP-R自然ambiguity无显著差异（KS p>0.05）， 但parse depth显著偏高（p=0.04）。原因：matched-pair design要求每条clause同时有ambiguous和unambiguous版本， 这种对称性约束倾向于生成稍微更复杂的句式结构（需要足够的syntactic depth来embed ambiguity而不显得artificial）。 sentence length也略偏高（18.4 vs 16.2 words）但未达显著。\\n这是一个honest limitation：合成clause比natural policy text slightly more syntactically complex。 但effect direction是conservative的——如果更复杂的句子导致更多ambiguity detection， 那么real-world effect可能更大（simpler sentences中ambiguity更隐蔽）。 4/5 non-significant足以address RC4 at reasonable level，parse depth差异在limitations中报告。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"classifier_poc\",\n    \"description\": \"DeBERTa-v3-large fine-tuned binary ambiguity detector，在annotated clause pairs上训练和评估。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"training_clauses\": 240,\n      \"test_clauses\": 60,\n      \"epochs\": 5,\n      \"gpu_hours_used\": 3,\n      \"accuracy\": 0.82,\n      \"f1_ambiguous\": 0.8,\n      \"f1_unambiguous\": 0.84,\n      \"precision_ambiguous\": 0.78,\n      \"recall_ambiguous\": 0.82,\n      \"auc_roc\": 0.88,\n      \"hardest_types_f1\": {\n        \"incompleteness\": 0.72,\n        \"authorization_scope\": 0.75\n      },\n      \"easiest_types_f1\": {\n        \"conditional_precedence\": 0.9,\n        \"scopal\": 0.86\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 14: Binary Ambiguity Classifier Performance\",\n        \"description\": \"Overall accuracy, F1, precision, recall, AUC-ROC, and per-type F1 breakdown\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Classifier PoC验证binary detection的feasibility但不足以作为independent contribution。 per-type F1的variance（0.72-0.90）有趣地mirror了linguistic visibility的gradient： 显式冲突（CP）最容易检测，缺失信息（incompleteness）最难检测。 这间接支持C3 visibility hypothesis——visible ambiguity既easier for models to detect as violations 也easier for classifiers to detect as ambiguity。 如果paper space tight，classifier results可以移至appendix或完全省略。\\n\\n整体accuracy 82%和F1 0.80属于reasonable PoC水平，证明binary detection是feasible但远非production-ready。 incompleteness最难检测（F1=0.72）因为缺失信息的absence本身难以被language model捕捉 （需要world knowledge about what SHOULD be specified）。 authorization_scope也偏难（F1=0.75）因为权限边界的ambiguity经常依赖domain-specific knowledge。 CP最容易（F1=0.90）因为显式冲突有强lexical cues（\\\"unless\\\", \\\"except\\\", \\\"notwithstanding\\\"）。 scopal较容易（F1=0.86）因为scope ambiguity有structural patterns（attachment height, quantifier scope） that DeBERTa can learn from syntactic representations。\\n这不是一个strong contribution本身——82% accuracy不足以deploy—— 但足以demonstrate practical applicability of findings并justify future work。 在EMNLP论文中定位为§7 Discussion的\\\"practical implications\\\"小节（1段）， 而非独立section。如果时间紧张这是第一个可以cut的实验。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":314,"startLine":1,"totalLines":314}}}
